    {
      "chapter": "122425",
      "source_id": "211-122425-0073",
      "speaker": "211",
      "transcript": "OF WHICH THE DOCTOR SAYS BAD THINGS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "84d8cc9ea2e979c9888aabd556a377deb46e79cfdcb14622aa973ef640c5c2ca",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/211/122425/211-122425.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "122425",
      "source_id": "211-122425-0070",
      "speaker": "211",
      "transcript": "AND ALL THE FAULT IS WITH YOUR MUSKETEERS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "84d8cc9ea2e979c9888aabd556a377deb46e79cfdcb14622aa973ef640c5c2ca",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/211/122425/211-122425.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "128985",
      "source_id": "332-128985-0027",
      "speaker": "332",
      "transcript": "HE WAS CRUISING ABOUT CAMPEACHY WITHOUT SEEING ANY CRAFT THAT WAS WORTH CAPTURING",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "be7351f622cdf779d282cf6d9e75b65ab1c04bf0918519a11d544908d77776e2",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/332/128985/332-128985.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "128985",
      "source_id": "332-128985-0088",
      "speaker": "332",
      "transcript": "AND AFTER THAT HE ENTIRELY DROPPED ROC FROM HIS CHRONICLES",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "be7351f622cdf779d282cf6d9e75b65ab1c04bf0918519a11d544908d77776e2",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/332/128985/332-128985.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "12761",
      "source_id": "5778-12761-0032",
      "speaker": "5778",
      "transcript": "WHEN IT WAS A COLD MOUNTAIN TORRENT FOAMING AMONG THE ROCKS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "3dad2f02f8dde3220f9cd7b7dac79cee5e9d7b9a01b37f4db0da9b86f587afd1",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/5778/12761/5778-12761.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "12761",
      "source_id": "5778-12761-0049",
      "speaker": "5778",
      "transcript": "SHORTLY THE ADVANCE PARTY REACHED SUTTER'S FORT WHERE THEY RECEIVED THE MOST HOSPITABLE TREATMENT",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "3dad2f02f8dde3220f9cd7b7dac79cee5e9d7b9a01b37f4db0da9b86f587afd1",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/5778/12761/5778-12761.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "39621",
      "source_id": "5561-39621-0022",
      "speaker": "5561",
      "transcript": "MAKE WAY MONSIEUR L'HOTELIER TO THE ENTRANCE OF YOUR HOUSE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "b511f2d53952c1cb52916373e47acfca34ab80d66f4ee0a39089d643715880d7",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/5561/39621/5561-39621.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "41616",
      "source_id": "5561-41616-0018",
      "speaker": "5561",
      "transcript": "THE JUNIORS FOREVER HURRAH FANS HURRAH OUR TEAM IS A WINNER OUR",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "83d0697e26ee0ade184664e2de36ce94d808b17740667c660bf465360c2929a5",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/5561/41616/5561-41616.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "59157",
      "source_id": "7148-59157-0019",
      "speaker": "7148",
      "transcript": "AND WROTE THE ODE TO AUTUMN",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "633501f7b9d0e33e4e4f1868a0f6624f509f70592dc1f51bd24670d182b6989d",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/7148/59157/7148-59157.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "59157",
      "source_id": "7148-59157-0022",
      "speaker": "7148",
      "transcript": "DOES HIS BEST TO BE FAIR TO FANNY",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "633501f7b9d0e33e4e4f1868a0f6624f509f70592dc1f51bd24670d182b6989d",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/7148/59157/7148-59157.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "18515",
      "source_id": "5163-18515-0002",
      "speaker": "5163",
      "transcript": "PERHAPS SO SAID POLLY",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "b47cee91e08da81374da663292bdffe200d56de5b9f8cac6e38589cd6488b67b",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/5163/18515/5163-18515.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "39921",
      "source_id": "5163-39921-0056",
      "speaker": "5163",
      "transcript": "I NEVER KNEW ISAAC CROPPER TO CHANGE HIS OPINIONS SO HANDSOMELY ESTHER SMILED",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "8d11fb6811518a45f1053b7afd8474c1d5bc2f22333808cb569692414e174fd6",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/5163/39921/5163-39921.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "127786",
      "source_id": "201-127786-0023",
      "speaker": "201",
      "transcript": "THEY ARE IN SHORT PEASANTS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "e74f0d66c024c2f15813fb23edf132dae01a60658c997b1a452f1c7083cc47ba",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/201/127786/201-127786.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "122255",
      "source_id": "201-122255-0008",
      "speaker": "201",
      "transcript": "BESIDES ALL THIS HE DEARLY LOVED THE LONGBOW",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "57262870056fdada5967a0a3fb3f5bfba4b13907b0ebc3dc1fc5fc3a8bcbfae4",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/201/122255/201-122255.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "112602",
      "source_id": "8014-112602-0025",
      "speaker": "8014",
      "transcript": "IN SKY SEA FLOWERS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "91a8df745206e6a36a15d3d554c0fc374a5822121c79eaae332b45b863487521",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/8014/112602/8014-112602.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "112602",
      "source_id": "8014-112602-0004",
      "speaker": "8014",
      "transcript": "LADIES OFTEN DYED THE EYEBROWS BLACK WITH THE JUICE OF SOME SORT OF BERRY",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "91a8df745206e6a36a15d3d554c0fc374a5822121c79eaae332b45b863487521",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/8014/112602/8014-112602.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "122615",
      "source_id": "1502-122615-0031",
      "speaker": "1502",
      "transcript": "THE WICKED CHIPPEWAS CHEATED MY SQUAW",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "8a8e81669494ce45143e7f15015a9977a89d65fb422f3a6e26f400daf6a549a2",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/1502/122615/1502-122615.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "122619",
      "source_id": "1502-122619-0086",
      "speaker": "1502",
      "transcript": "THE HURON CHIEF THEREFORE STEPPED EAGERLY OUT A LITTLE FROM THE THRONG",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "5e9a0374d6bc0a4f334d299794490275f178428d8b07607ccef65ebdbc636ad6",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/1502/122619/1502-122619.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "128988",
      "source_id": "441-128988-0000",
      "speaker": "441",
      "transcript": "CHAPTER THIRTEEN A RESURRECTED PIRATE",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "b194346044000f58ba7c0c365e42a96a2dbe621a120c478d4c945e4feebb7764",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/441/128988/441-128988.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "130108",
      "source_id": "441-130108-0035",
      "speaker": "441",
      "transcript": "YOU'VE BEEN JAWIN LIKE A LOT A OLD HENS",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "56081880c5e0a75e6d6fc6c0527e7eb87321a1e818a3bf20b4e74d3a7e4cbb1d",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/441/130108/441-130108.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "122822",
      "source_id": "426-122822-0015",
      "speaker": "426",
      "transcript": "BUT THE KNOWLEDGE ONLY ANGERED HER FURTHER",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "17e2024b3e7bf98e1cea286beadae4a03900e6f59a26972b7094078d572d2177",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/426/122822/426-122822.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "122819",
      "source_id": "426-122819-0015",
      "speaker": "426",
      "transcript": "HE'S PECULIAR ENOUGH ALL RIGHT THEN SAID MISTER HARRISON DRILY",
      "transcript_file_sha256": "60278746290da087cbd2ea88e8e6d8a9b9910c155cf06e7f7589bbc3f4ca8ec6",
      "transcript_member": "LibriSpeech/train-clean-100/426/122819/426-122819.trans.txt"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "261139",
      "source_id": "8629-261139-0060",
